// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`default help > hides repository tools from everyday help and bounds every human help line 1`] = `
"wholeloop 1.1.0 — define, build, roll out and learn

Usage: wl <command> [options]

Get started:
  install                        Install wholeloop in your coding client.
  doctor                         Find installation problems.
  setup                          Choose how you want to work.
  uninstall                      Remove an owned installation.

Your work:
  status [<id>]                  See work and pending decisions.
  next [<idea|id|URL>]           Continue work or start an idea.
  resume [<id>]                  Pick up an item with its recent context.
  overview                       See what needs attention across work.
  watch                          Follow changes without starting work.

Preferences:
  profile show                   See your interaction preferences.
  profile preset <name>          Choose an interaction preset.
  config show                    See the effective settings.

More commands, by group:
  Define
    research frame spec scopes challenge
  Build
    slices worktree build exec verify review gate pr fanout
  Rollout and learn
    launch ramp env measure learn
  Items and messages
    state step answer msg handoff note link open sync share adopt
  Configuration
    config profile provider template lens mcp discover resolve
  Autonomous delivery (experimental)
    delivery maintenance eval

Options:
  -v, --version   Print the version
  -h, --help      Print help; after a command or group, print help for it
  --json          Print a versioned JSON payload

Run 'wl <command> --help' for one command, 'wl <group> --help' for a group,
or 'wl --help --all' for every command, including repository and maintainer
tools."
`;
